[gd_resource type="Environment" load_steps=4 format=3]
; Origin: S:\Repos\trick-or-treat\game\scenes\main.tscn (sub-resources NightEnv, NightSky, SkyMat) (imported 2026-10-25)
; Changes: extracted from the game scene into a standalone Environment; the sky shader path points at the addon
; (was res://shaders/sky.gdshader). Values unchanged. The game sets the sky's moon_dir / cloud_cover per seed at
; runtime (C++ FestivalGame); the defaults here are the shader's own (moon_dir 0.3, 0.4, -0.86; cloud_cover 0.5).
; SSAO / SSIL / glow / tonemap values are the XCOM "Latest 2" shipped preset (see presets/project_settings_rendering.md).

